  "eyebrow": "VOCR5  ·  Japanese OCR for PS Vita and PSP visual novels",
  "headline": "Reads dialogue as well as Google Lens. Offline.",
  "subhead": "Character error rate on visual-novel dialogue, three test sets. Lower is better.",
  "panel": {
   "kicker": "Built for the console",
   "big": "{N_MB}",
   "big_sub": "the default model's int8 weights",
   "lines": [
    "Offline, in the game's own memory",
